[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8162.47, "timestamp": "02:16:02", "text": "一路飞到顶峰。坚持，稍等。让我买"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8165.91, "timestamp": "02:16:05", "text": "一些垃圾袋。兄弟，我要买了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8167.75, "timestamp": "02:16:07", "text": "四个，因为你们都太脏了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8170.629, "timestamp": "02:16:10", "text": "混蛋。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8184.69, "timestamp": "02:16:24", "text": "你们将会灭亡。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8186.109, "timestamp": "02:16:26", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8189.669, "timestamp": "02:16:29", "text": "不，不。好吧，我要回去了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8191.27, "timestamp": "02:16:31", "text": "那。好了，伙计们，继续清理。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8205.19, "timestamp": "02:16:45", "text": "去。我从中获得了多少收益？ 64."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8207.99, "timestamp": "02:16:47", "text": "我的天啊，兄弟。等等，我可能只是个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8209.669, "timestamp": "02:16:49", "text": "垃圾收集员。那会让我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8212.389, "timestamp": "02:16:52", "text": "钱。我的天啊。兄弟，你偷了我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8214.709, "timestamp": "02:16:54", "text": "他妈的钱。搞什么鬼？我觉得我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8217.11, "timestamp": "02:16:57", "text": "好好想想工作的事吧，伙计。去你妈的"}]